    "Needs: Ysida Harmon's cage (GO_CAGE_YSIDA) starts the 45-minute Baron run for Rivendare's death",
    "Needs: Order of the Silver Hand bosses (Jarien 16101, Sothos 16102, Turtle) are script-driven",
    "Live side of map 329 (left entrance 2217 is equivalent); Baron Rivendare is in stratholme_undead."
